[__objmodmethod |F __objModMethod( <oObject>, <cMethodName>, <nFuncPtr> ) --> oObject|Modify (replace) a METHOD in an already existing class ]
__objModMethod( <oObject>, <cMethodName>, <nFuncPtr> ) --> oObject

[__objsetvaluelist |F __objSetValueList( <oObject>, <aData> ) --> oObject|Set object with an array of VAR names and values ]
__objSetValueList( <oObject>, <aData> ) --> oObject

[__setcentury |F __SetCentury([<lFlag>  OR  <cOnOff> ] ) --> lPreviousValue|Set the Current Century ]
__SetCentury([<lFlag>  OR  <cOnOff> ] ) --> lPreviousValue

[__typefile |F __TypeFile( <cFile>, [<lPrint>] ) --> NIL|Show the content of a file on the console and/or printer ]
__TypeFile( <cFile>, [<lPrint>] ) --> NIL

